        "created_at": "2013-11-21T14:49:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There's at least one environment card which says you can get rid of it if each player discards the top three cards of their deck (might be Fire in the Biosphere but off the top of my head I can't remember so maybe it's River of Lava...I have a fiery image in my head when I think of it anyway). Cards can also be discarded from the top of the environment deck when fighting Akash'Bhuta and a target from her deck either enters play or is destroyed (depending on which side she's on).</p>",
